{"id":"4acbe0566d8aa39d","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/003_Peirce_存在图系统.md","title":"003 Peirce 存在图系统","display":"003_Peirce_存在图系统","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>修订状态：repair-candidate。原审查评级仅针对备份的原始字节；本稿为授权修复候选。</p>\n</blockquote>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始数据\">1. 原始数据</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Atom}=\\{a_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Atom}=\\{a_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为原子图标号集合。Peirce alpha 存在图的原始图构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{empty},\\operatorname{atom},\\operatorname{par},\\operatorname{cut}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{empty},\\operatorname{atom},\\operatorname{par},\\operatorname{cut}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{par}\">\\(\\operatorname{par}\\)</span> 表示同一区域中的有限并置，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cut}\">\\(\\operatorname{cut}\\)</span> 表示一条封闭切线包围的子图。图没有变量绑定；切线改变区域极性。</p>\n<p>目标差异为：本系统的基本对象是存在图 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\">\\(\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\\)</span>，推导行属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\">\\(\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\\)</span>，并且规则按正负孔位置重写图。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-图对象\">2. 图对象</h1>\n<p>定义图集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\">\\(\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\\)</span> 为满足下列条件的最小集合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2.1-空图\">2.1 空图</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{empty}\\in\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{empty}\\in\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"2.2-原子图\">2.2 原子图</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathsf{Atom}\">\\(a\\in\\mathsf{Atom}\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(a)\\in\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom}(a)\\in\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"2.3-有限并置\">2.3 有限并置</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma:n\\to\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\">\\(\\gamma:n\\to\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{par}(\\gamma)\\in\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{par}(\\gamma)\\in\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=0\">\\(n=0\\)</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{par}(\\gamma)\">\\(\\operatorname{par}(\\gamma)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{empty}\">\\(\\operatorname{empty}\\)</span> 属于不同构造项；结构等价在第 4 节处理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2.4-切线\">2.4 切线</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\in\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\">\\(G\\in\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cut}(G)\\in\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{cut}(G)\\in\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"3.-原子名、替换与无绑定声明\">3. 原子名、替换与无绑定声明</h1>\n<p>定义原子名函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{At}:\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Atom})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{At}:\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Atom})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{At}(\\operatorname{empty})=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{At}(\\operatorname{empty})=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{At}(\\operatorname{atom}(a))=\\{a\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{At}(\\operatorname{atom}(a))=\\{a\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{At}(\\operatorname{par}(\\gamma))\n=\n\\bigcup_{i&lt;n}\\operatorname{At}(\\gamma(i)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{At}(\\operatorname{par}(\\gamma))\n=\n\\bigcup_{i&lt;n}\\operatorname{At}(\\gamma(i)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{At}(\\operatorname{cut}(G))=\\operatorname{At}(G).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{At}(\\operatorname{cut}(G))=\\operatorname{At}(G).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义自由原子名函数：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}_{EG}:\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Atom}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FN}_{EG}(G)=\\operatorname{At}(G).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}_{EG}:\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Atom}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FN}_{EG}(G)=\\operatorname{At}(G).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原子替换为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{EG}:\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\\times\\mathsf{Atom}\\times\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\\to\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{EG}:\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\\times\\mathsf{Atom}\\times\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\\to\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G[a:=H]\">\\(G[a:=H]\\)</span>，其子句为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{empty}[a:=H]=\\operatorname{empty},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{empty}[a:=H]=\\operatorname{empty},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(b)[a:=H]=\n\\begin{cases}\nH,&amp;b=a,\\\\\n\\operatorname{atom}(b),&amp;b\\ne a,\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom}(b)[a:=H]=\n\\begin{cases}\nH,&amp;b=a,\\\\\n\\operatorname{atom}(b),&amp;b\\ne a,\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{par}(\\gamma)[a:=H]=\\operatorname{par}(\\gamma&#39;)\n\\quad\\text{且}\\quad\n\\gamma&#39;(i)=\\gamma(i)[a:=H],\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{par}(\\gamma)[a:=H]=\\operatorname{par}(\\gamma&#39;)\n\\quad\\text{且}\\quad\n\\gamma&#39;(i)=\\gamma(i)[a:=H],\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cut}(G)[a:=H]=\\operatorname{cut}(G[a:=H]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{cut}(G)[a:=H]=\\operatorname{cut}(G[a:=H]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本系统无变量绑定。定义绑定原子函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{EG}:\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Atom})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{EG}:\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Atom})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为常空函数：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{EG}(G)=\\varnothing\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{EG}(G)=\\varnothing\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\in\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\">\\(G\\in\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\\)</span> 成立。定义自由出现函数：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{EG}:\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Atom}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{EG}(G)=\\operatorname{FN}_{EG}(G).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{EG}:\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Atom}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{EG}(G)=\\operatorname{FN}_{EG}(G).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价为第 4 节结构等价。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-结构等价\">4. 结构等价</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{EG}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\\times\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_{EG}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\\times\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为下列关系族的交集：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{EG}=\\bigcap\\mathcal E_{EG}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_{EG}=\\bigcap\\mathcal E_{EG}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_{EG}\">\\(\\mathcal E_{EG}\\)</span> 是所有满足下列条件的关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\\times\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\">\\(E\\subseteq\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\\times\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\\)</span> 的集合。</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\">\\(\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\\)</span> 上的等价关系。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathsf{Atom}\">\\(a\\in\\mathsf{Atom}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\operatorname{atom}(a),\\operatorname{atom}(a))\\in E\">\\((\\operatorname{atom}(a),\\operatorname{atom}(a))\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\operatorname{empty},\\operatorname{empty})\\in E\">\\((\\operatorname{empty},\\operatorname{empty})\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(G,H)\\in E\">\\((G,H)\\in E\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\operatorname{cut}(G),\\operatorname{cut}(H))\\in E\">\\((\\operatorname{cut}(G),\\operatorname{cut}(H))\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma,\\delta:n\\to\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\">\\(\\gamma,\\delta:n\\to\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\gamma(i),\\delta(i))\\in E\">\\((\\gamma(i),\\delta(i))\\in E\\)</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;n\">\\(i&lt;n\\)</span> 成立，则</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\operatorname{par}(\\gamma),\\operatorname{par}(\\delta))\\in E.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\operatorname{par}(\\gamma),\\operatorname{par}(\\delta))\\in E.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><ol start=\"6\">\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:n\\to n\">\\(\\sigma:n\\to n\\)</span> 是有限置换，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta(i)=\\gamma(\\sigma(i))\">\\(\\delta(i)=\\gamma(\\sigma(i))\\)</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;n\">\\(i&lt;n\\)</span> 成立，则</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\operatorname{par}(\\gamma),\\operatorname{par}(\\delta))\\in E.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\operatorname{par}(\\gamma),\\operatorname{par}(\\delta))\\in E.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><ol start=\"7\">\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma:n\\to\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\">\\(\\gamma:n\\to\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma(k)=\\operatorname{par}(\\delta)\">\\(\\gamma(k)=\\operatorname{par}(\\delta)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta:m\\to\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\">\\(\\delta:m\\to\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k&lt;n\">\\(k&lt;n\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma^{\\flat}:n+m-1\\to\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\">\\(\\gamma^{\\flat}:n+m-1\\to\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\\)</span> 为把第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 个分量替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta(0),\\ldots,\\delta(m-1)\">\\(\\delta(0),\\ldots,\\delta(m-1)\\)</span> 后得到的列，则</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\operatorname{par}(\\gamma),\\operatorname{par}(\\gamma^{\\flat}))\\in E.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\operatorname{par}(\\gamma),\\operatorname{par}(\\gamma^{\\flat}))\\in E.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><ol start=\"8\">\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma:n\\to\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\">\\(\\gamma:n\\to\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma(k)=\\operatorname{empty}\">\\(\\gamma(k)=\\operatorname{empty}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k&lt;n\">\\(k&lt;n\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma^{-k}:n-1\\to\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\">\\(\\gamma^{-k}:n-1\\to\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\\)</span> 为删除第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 个分量后的列，则</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\operatorname{par}(\\gamma),\\operatorname{par}(\\gamma^{-k}))\\in E.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\operatorname{par}(\\gamma),\\operatorname{par}(\\gamma^{-k}))\\in E.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该等价只处理图的并置结构，不把双重切线视为等价。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-图上下文与极性\">5. 图上下文与极性</h1>\n<p>图上下文集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ctx}_{EG}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ctx}_{EG}\\)</span> 是含一个孔 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"*\">\\(*\\)</span> 的图结构，按下列最小闭包定义：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"*\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{EG}\">\\(*\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{EG}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{EG}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{EG}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma:n\\to\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\">\\(\\gamma:n\\to\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\le n\">\\(k\\le n\\)</span>，则</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{parctx}(\\gamma,k,C)\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{EG};\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{parctx}(\\gamma,k,C)\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{EG};\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><ol start=\"3\">\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{EG}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{EG}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cutctx}(C)\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{EG}\">\\(\\operatorname{cutctx}(C)\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{EG}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>孔填充函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}:\\mathsf{Ctx}_{EG}\\times\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\\to\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plug}:\\mathsf{Ctx}_{EG}\\times\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\\to\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由下列子句定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}(*,G)=G,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plug}(*,G)=G,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}(\\operatorname{parctx}(\\gamma,k,C),G)\n=\n\\operatorname{par}(\\delta),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plug}(\\operatorname{parctx}(\\gamma,k,C),G)\n=\n\\operatorname{par}(\\delta),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta:n+1\\to\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\">\\(\\delta:n+1\\to\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\\)</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\">\\(\\gamma\\)</span> 的前 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 个分量、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}(C,G)\">\\(\\operatorname{plug}(C,G)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\">\\(\\gamma\\)</span> 的剩余分量组成。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}(\\operatorname{cutctx}(C),G)\n=\n\\operatorname{cut}(\\operatorname{plug}(C,G)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plug}(\\operatorname{cutctx}(C),G)\n=\n\\operatorname{cut}(\\operatorname{plug}(C,G)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义孔深</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{depth}(*)=0,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{depth}(*)=0,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{depth}(\\operatorname{parctx}(\\gamma,k,C))=\\operatorname{depth}(C),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{depth}(\\operatorname{parctx}(\\gamma,k,C))=\\operatorname{depth}(C),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{depth}(\\operatorname{cutctx}(C))=\\operatorname{depth}(C)+1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{depth}(\\operatorname{cutctx}(C))=\\operatorname{depth}(C)+1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>正孔与负孔谓词为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pos}(C)\\Longleftrightarrow \\operatorname{depth}(C)\\equiv 0\\pmod 2,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Pos}(C)\\Longleftrightarrow \\operatorname{depth}(C)\\equiv 0\\pmod 2,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Neg}(C)\\Longleftrightarrow \\operatorname{depth}(C)\\equiv 1\\pmod 2.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Neg}(C)\\Longleftrightarrow \\operatorname{depth}(C)\\equiv 1\\pmod 2.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-图规则关系\">6. 图规则关系</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\sqcup H\">\\(G\\sqcup H\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{par}\">\\(\\operatorname{par}\\)</span> 并置二元图，即</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"G\\sqcup H=\\operatorname{par}(\\gamma_{G,H}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[G\\sqcup H=\\operatorname{par}(\\gamma_{G,H}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma_{G,H}:2\\to\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\">\\(\\gamma_{G,H}:2\\to\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\\)</span>，并满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\gamma_{G,H}(0)=G,\\qquad \\gamma_{G,H}(1)=H.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\gamma_{G,H}(0)=G,\\qquad \\gamma_{G,H}(1)=H.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>擦除规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Erase}\n=\n\\{((\\operatorname{plug}(C,G\\sqcup H)),\\operatorname{plug}(C,G)):\nC\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{EG},\\operatorname{Pos}(C),G,H\\in\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Erase}\n=\n\\{((\\operatorname{plug}(C,G\\sqcup H)),\\operatorname{plug}(C,G)):\nC\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{EG},\\operatorname{Pos}(C),G,H\\in\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>插入规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Insert}\n=\n\\{((\\operatorname{plug}(C,G)),\\operatorname{plug}(C,G\\sqcup H)):\nC\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{EG},\\operatorname{Neg}(C),G,H\\in\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Insert}\n=\n\\{((\\operatorname{plug}(C,G)),\\operatorname{plug}(C,G\\sqcup H)):\nC\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{EG},\\operatorname{Neg}(C),G,H\\in\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>双切线擦除与引入为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{DoubleCut}\n=\n\\{((\\operatorname{plug}(C,\\operatorname{cut}(\\operatorname{cut}(G)))),\\operatorname{plug}(C,G)),\n((\\operatorname{plug}(C,G)),\\operatorname{plug}(C,\\operatorname{cut}(\\operatorname{cut}(G)))):\nC\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{EG},G\\in\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{DoubleCut}\n=\n\\{((\\operatorname{plug}(C,\\operatorname{cut}(\\operatorname{cut}(G)))),\\operatorname{plug}(C,G)),\n((\\operatorname{plug}(C,G)),\\operatorname{plug}(C,\\operatorname{cut}(\\operatorname{cut}(G)))):\nC\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{EG},G\\in\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>迭代与反迭代规则使用两个单孔上下文的两阶段机制：单孔上下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 定位被复制图 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 在原图中的出现，单孔上下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C&#39;\">\\(C&#39;\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 的孔位置所属区域内定位目标区域（其既有内容记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C&#39;\">\\(C&#39;\\)</span> 可穿过任意多条切线，目标区域的深度任意、不限奇偶。</p>\n<p>迭代规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Iter}\n=\n\\{((\\operatorname{plug}(C,G\\sqcup\\operatorname{plug}(C&#39;,H))),\n\\operatorname{plug}(C,G\\sqcup\\operatorname{plug}(C&#39;,H\\sqcup G))):\nC,C&#39;\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{EG},G,H\\in\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Iter}\n=\n\\{((\\operatorname{plug}(C,G\\sqcup\\operatorname{plug}(C&#39;,H))),\n\\operatorname{plug}(C,G\\sqcup\\operatorname{plug}(C&#39;,H\\sqcup G))):\nC,C&#39;\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{EG},G,H\\in\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>反迭代规则为其逆：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Deiter}\n=\n\\{((\\operatorname{plug}(C,G\\sqcup\\operatorname{plug}(C&#39;,H\\sqcup G))),\n\\operatorname{plug}(C,G\\sqcup\\operatorname{plug}(C&#39;,H))):\nC,C&#39;\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{EG},G,H\\in\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Deiter}\n=\n\\{((\\operatorname{plug}(C,G\\sqcup\\operatorname{plug}(C&#39;,H\\sqcup G))),\n\\operatorname{plug}(C,G\\sqcup\\operatorname{plug}(C&#39;,H))):\nC,C&#39;\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{EG},G,H\\in\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>迭代把出现于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 的孔位置的图 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 复制到由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C&#39;\">\\(C&#39;\\)</span> 定位的区域中（与该区域既有内容 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 并置）；当同一区域存在复本 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 时，反迭代删去由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C&#39;\">\\(C&#39;\\)</span> 定位的更深或同层区域中的复本。两条规则不施加孔位置极性条件；极性条件只属于擦除与插入规则。</p>\n<p>结构等价规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Struct}\n=\n\\{((G),H):G,H\\in\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG},G\\equiv_{EG}H\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Struct}\n=\n\\{((G),H):G,H\\in\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG},G\\equiv_{EG}H\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总图重写关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{EG}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Erase}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Insert}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{DoubleCut}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Iter}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Deiter}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Struct}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{EG}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Erase}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Insert}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{DoubleCut}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Iter}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Deiter}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Struct}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>目标差异谓词定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{EG}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{EG}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Erase}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{Insert}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{DoubleCut}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{Iter}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{Deiter}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{Struct}\n\\land\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{EG}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_{EG}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{EG}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Erase}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{Insert}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{DoubleCut}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{Iter}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{Deiter}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{Struct}\n\\land\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{EG}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中每个规则的前件与后件都属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\">\\(\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\\)</span>；擦除与插入受已定义的孔位置极性条件（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pos}\">\\(\\operatorname{Pos}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Neg}\">\\(\\operatorname{Neg}\\)</span>）约束，迭代与反迭代不施加极性条件，而由两阶段单孔上下文机制约束。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-推导对象\">7. 推导对象</h1>\n<p>初始图集合和公理图集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Init}_{EG}=\\{\\operatorname{empty}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{EG}=\\mathsf{Init}_{EG}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Init}_{EG}=\\{\\operatorname{empty}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{EG}=\\mathsf{Init}_{EG}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>从图 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 到图 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 的存在图推导是非空有限序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(G_0,\\ldots,G_{m-1})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi=(G_0,\\ldots,G_{m-1})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_0=G\">\\(G_0=G\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_{m-1}=H\">\\(G_{m-1}=H\\)</span>，并且每个后继 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_{i+1}\">\\(G_{i+1}\\)</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_i\">\\(G_i\\)</span> 按下列关系之一得到：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Erase},\\quad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Insert},\\quad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{DoubleCut},\\quad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Iter},\\quad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Deiter},\\quad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Struct}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Erase},\\quad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Insert},\\quad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{DoubleCut},\\quad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Iter},\\quad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Deiter},\\quad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Struct}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义一步许可谓词</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{StepOK}_{EG}(G,H)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n((G),H)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{EG}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{StepOK}_{EG}(G,H)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n((G),H)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{EG}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义推导对象集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Der}_{EG}(G,H)\n=\n\\{\\pi=(G_0,\\ldots,G_{m-1}):m&gt;0\\land G_0=G\\land G_{m-1}=H\n\\land \\forall i&lt;m-1\\ \\operatorname{StepOK}_{EG}(G_i,G_{i+1})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Der}_{EG}(G,H)\n=\n\\{\\pi=(G_0,\\ldots,G_{m-1}):m&gt;0\\land G_0=G\\land G_{m-1}=H\n\\land \\forall i&lt;m-1\\ \\operatorname{StepOK}_{EG}(G_i,G_{i+1})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>从假设图集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\\)</span> 出发的证明对象集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{EG}(\\Gamma)\n=\n\\{\\pi=(G_0,\\ldots,G_{m-1}):m&gt;0\n\\land G_0\\in\\Gamma\n\\land \\forall i&lt;m\\ G_i\\in\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\n\\land \\forall i&lt;m-1\\ \\operatorname{StepOK}_{EG}(G_i,G_{i+1})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Proof}_{EG}(\\Gamma)\n=\n\\{\\pi=(G_0,\\ldots,G_{m-1}):m&gt;0\n\\land G_0\\in\\Gamma\n\\land \\forall i&lt;m\\ G_i\\in\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}\n\\land \\forall i&lt;m-1\\ \\operatorname{StepOK}_{EG}(G_i,G_{i+1})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-可推导关系\">8. 可推导关系</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{EG}H\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{EG}H\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(G_0,\\ldots,G_{m-1})\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{EG}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi=(G_0,\\ldots,G_{m-1})\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{EG}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_{m-1}=H\">\\(G_{m-1}=H\\)</span>。无假设证明从公理图集合出发（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{EG}=\\mathsf{Init}_{EG}=\\{\\operatorname{empty}\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{EG}=\\mathsf{Init}_{EG}=\\{\\operatorname{empty}\\}\\)</span>，即白纸图），定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{EG}H\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{EG}\\vdash_{EG}H.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\vdash_{EG}H\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{EG}\\vdash_{EG}H.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-整个形式系统\">9. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{ExistentialGraph}\n=\n(\n\\mathsf{Atom},\n\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG},\n\\mathsf{Ctx}_{EG},\n\\operatorname{At},\n\\operatorname{FN}_{EG},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{EG},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{EG},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{EG},\n\\equiv_{EG},\n\\operatorname{plug},\n\\operatorname{Pos},\n\\operatorname{Neg},\n\\mathsf{Init}_{EG},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{EG},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Erase},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Insert},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{DoubleCut},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Iter},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Deiter},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Struct},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{EG},\n\\operatorname{StepOK}_{EG},\n\\mathsf{Der}_{EG},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{EG},\n\\vdash_{EG},\n\\Delta_{EG}\n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{ExistentialGraph}\n=\n(\n\\mathsf{Atom},\n\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG},\n\\mathsf{Ctx}_{EG},\n\\operatorname{At},\n\\operatorname{FN}_{EG},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{EG},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{EG},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{EG},\n\\equiv_{EG},\n\\operatorname{plug},\n\\operatorname{Pos},\n\\operatorname{Neg},\n\\mathsf{Init}_{EG},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{EG},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Erase},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Insert},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{DoubleCut},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Iter},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Deiter},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Struct},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{EG},\n\\operatorname{StepOK}_{EG},\n\\mathsf{Der}_{EG},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{EG},\n\\vdash_{EG},\n\\Delta_{EG}\n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该最终元组只给出图句法、位置极性、重写规则、有限证明对象和可推导关系；不含图的语义解释、满足关系或有效性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-原始数据","text":"1. 原始数据","level":1},{"id":"2.-图对象","text":"2. 图对象","level":1},{"id":"2.1-空图","text":"2.1 空图","level":2},{"id":"2.2-原子图","text":"2.2 原子图","level":2},{"id":"2.3-有限并置","text":"2.3 有限并置","level":2},{"id":"2.4-切线","text":"2.4 切线","level":2},{"id":"3.-原子名、替换与无绑定声明","text":"3. 原子名、替换与无绑定声明","level":1},{"id":"4.-结构等价","text":"4. 结构等价","level":1},{"id":"5.-图上下文与极性","text":"5. 图上下文与极性","level":1},{"id":"6.-图规则关系","text":"6. 图规则关系","level":1},{"id":"7.-推导对象","text":"7. 推导对象","level":1},{"id":"8.-可推导关系","text":"8. 可推导关系","level":1},{"id":"9.-整个形式系统","text":"9. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{Atom}=\\{a_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{empty},\\operatorname{atom},\\operatorname{par},\\operatorname{cut}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{par}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{cut}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Graph}_{EG}","display":false},{"tex":"\\m